    "heading": "IDENTIFYING AN ONGOING SPELL",
    "lineStart": 7339,
    "lineEnd": 7341
  },
  "section": "7.28",
  "rulesText": "You can try to identify a non-instantaneous spell by its observable effects if its duration is ongoing. To identify it, you must take the Study action and succeed on a DC 15 Intelligence (Arcana) check."
}
